  "body": "Found by the second review of PR #2664 (comment 7001940070). This is the second half of #2600.\n\nFacts:\n- The stock simulation does not judge tilted moves. `verify` answers `ok: true` with `not_judged` for them.\n- The fix of #2600 relies on the gouge check at generation (the keep law in the frame of the plane).\n- The tests show that check only for Slot (`crates/app/tests/tilted_gouge.rs`).\n\nTask: for each operation type that accepts a tilt, add a test with a tilted operation that cuts into the part. The test asserts the refusal.\n\nA gap that this audit finds is a P1. File it as a new issue.\n",
